---
description: Do not auto-publish DBI Leader Dashboard edits
alwaysApply: true
---

Do NOT commit or push dashboard edits unless the user explicitly asks to publish a test or to push the update.

Future experiments edit `scan-test.js` only. Never replace `scan.js` except by the promote workflow (`.github/workflows/promote-scan.yml`), which copies the tested scan over the good one after the leader confirms Push update.

The good bookmark must keep loading `scan.js`. Publishing `scan-test.js` must not change `scan.js`.

Never force-push. Never update git config. Never commit secrets.
